<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets $4.0 billion repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets $4.0 billion repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy set an $4.0 billion repurchase tender for November 25 for resale on February 25, 1997.</p>
<p>The auction will be held tomorrow and the results will be announced soon afterwards.</p>
<p>The Bank said the lira/dollar rate on which the tender will be based will be announced tomorrow morning.</p>
</text>
